// Two server-side varps per patch. They are NOT transmitted: the client only ever needs the
// appearance varbit (which already exists in the cache), so everything below stays server-side.
//
// farming_time_N   - world minute at which this patch last advanced a growth stage.
// farming_flags_N  - bits 0-5 crop id (0 = empty), 6-8 harvest lives, 9-10 compost tier,
//                    bit 11 protected by a farmer, bit 12 checked (trees/bushes claimed their xp).

